=<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thank You - Precision Data Strategies</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c5aa0 0%, #1e4080 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            max-width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .company-name {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #2c5aa0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .main-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .info-section {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #2c5aa0;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
        }
        .info-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c5aa0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .info-item {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #555555;
            display: inline-block;
            min-width: 80px;
        }
        .summary-section {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .summary-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c5aa0;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .summary-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
        }
        .note {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #856404;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            color: #666666;
        }
        .signature-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c5aa0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #2c5aa0;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            .header, .content, .footer {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .company-name {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://precisiondatastrategies.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/PDS-logo.jpg" alt="Precision Data Strategies Logo" class="logo">
            <h1 class="company-name">Precision Data Strategies LLC</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">
                Dear {{ $fromAI('name') || 'prospective client' }},
            </div>

            <div class="main-text">
                Thank you for reaching out to us. We've received your request and our automations department will be in touch with you shortly to discuss your inquiry in more detail.
            </div>

            <div class="info-section">
                <div class="info-title">Summary of Information Received:</div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Name:</span> {{ $fromAI('name') || '' }}
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Company:</span> {{ $fromAI('company') || '' }}
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Email:</span> {{ $fromAI('email') || '' }}
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Phone:</span> {{ $fromAI('phone') || '' }}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="summary-section">
                <div class="summary-label">Summary of our discussion:</div>
                <div class="summary-text">{{ $fromAI('summary') || '' }}</div>
            </div>

            <div class="note">
                <strong>Please note:</strong> If you notice any errors in the details above, please reply to this email so we can update your information before our sales team contacts you.
            </div>

            <div class="main-text">
                We appreciate your interest and look forward to speaking with you soon.
            </div>

            <div class="signature">
                —<br>
                <span class="signature-name">Samantha</span><br>
                AI Assistant
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2025 Precision Data Strategies LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
